@baseUrl = http://localhost:5081

### Consultar catálogo -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Consultar producto existente -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### Consultar producto inexistente -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/999

### Crear producto -> 201 y Location: /products/{id}
# @name crearProducto
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Webcam", "price": 65 }

### Consultar el producto creado (ejecutar crearProducto primero) -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{crearProducto.response.body.$.id}}

### Nombre vacío -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "price": 10 }

### Nombre compuesto por espacios -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "   ", "price": 10 }

### Precio negativo -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Webcam", "price": -10 }

### Actualizar producto -> 200 (repetir: el precio se mantiene en 10)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mechanical Keyboard", "price": 10 }

### Actualización inválida -> 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": " ", "price": 10 }

### Actualización con precio negativo -> 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Keyboard", "price": -1 }

### Actualizar producto inexistente -> 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/999
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Keyboard", "price": 10 }

### Eliminar producto -> 204 sin cuerpo (repetir devuelve 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/2

### Confirmar resultado de la eliminación -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/2

### Eliminar producto inexistente -> 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/999
